#RegEx Patterns to show in RegEx Builder form. You can add or remove your own patterns
#If the file extensions is *.regexpatterns, then these are not read as GROK aliases, but just as a repository of regular expressions  and can be shown in RegEx Builder 
#if group name ends with _TIMESTAMP, _DATETIME, _TIME, _INTEGER, _INT, _DOUBLE, _FLOAT _REAL (in uppercase) the LPL will try to parse and convert the type to DateTime, Int32 or Double

DATA (?<Data>.*)
DATE (?<Date_DATETIME>%{YEAR}-%{MONTHNUM}-%{MONTHDAY})
FIELD_TILL_SPACE (?<Field1>.+?)\s+
FIELD_TILL_TAB (?<FieldTsv1>.+?)\t+
LOGGER %{WORD:Logger}
LOGLEVEL %{LOGLEVEL:LogLevel}
Log4NetTimestamp %{TIMESTAMP_ISO8601:Timestamp_TIMESTAMP}
MESSAGE (?<Message>.*?)$
PROCESSID %{INT:ProcessID_INT}
SPACE \s+
STRING (?<String>%{WORD}|%{QUOTEDSTRING})
THREADID %{INT:ThreadID_INT}
TIME (?<Time_TIME>%{HOUR}:?%{MINUTE}(?::?%{SECOND})?%{ISO8601_TIMEZONE}?)